Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.92,0:01:49.37,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}迈{\c}步向前活出自己风采
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.96,0:02:03.71,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}不{\c}曾料想会被投身于此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.71,0:02:08.50,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}却{\c}意外收获随心放纵日子 真Lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:11.35,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}但{\c}也别太松懈太大意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.57,0:02:14.19,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}麻{\c}烦一个接一个接踵而至
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.35,0:02:16.82,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}求{\c}求放过我吧Happening
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.11,0:02:19.66,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}不{\c}过也罢 即使这般境地
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.84,0:02:22.54,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}也{\c}绝不能认输 我可是Lv.MAX
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.09,0:02:27.85,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}正{\c}因有要守护的人与天地
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.02,0:02:30.65,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}才{\c}能变得更强 跨过困难障壁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.81,0:02:33.00,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}动{\c}起真格来我豪不掩饰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.21,0:02:36.12,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}无{\c}法预料的命运安排
