Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.02,0:02:41.55,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}与{\c}你相遇的今生此趟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.77,0:02:44.35,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}便{\c}已让我稳坐胜组人生
