Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.44,0:02:49.83,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}任{\c}何时候都全力对待
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.01,0:02:52.51,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}有{\c}哭有笑放开吃个自在
