Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.48,0:02:58.04,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{=7}{\fad(200,200)\c&H7600F0&\blur2}尽{\c}情享受吧 So☆Lucky
Comment: 0,0:21:40.56,0:21:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{=4}--------ED--------
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.80,0:21:55.58,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}念入りに書き込んだスケジュールも
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.13,0:22:02.01,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}今日は気分じゃなくて投げ出しました
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.48,0:22:06.39,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}大事な約束じゃなきゃたまには
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.82,0:22:12.32,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}行き当たりぱったりも　私っぽいや
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.82,0:22:17.38,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}相も変わらず毎日は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.49,0:22:20.57,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}慌ただしく続いて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.81,0:22:23.47,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}あれもこれも　予測できない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.47,0:22:27.23,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}こといっぱいで　退屈しないね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.38,0:22:30.96,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}さぁ　いっせーのせ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.14,0:22:34.55,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}今日はどれにしようかな
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.81,0:22:38.01,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}私が選ぶ思いのまま
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.16,0:22:41.55,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}迷ったりして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.80,0:22:46.98,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}踏み出していくんだ　Brand-new way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.15,0:22:52.66,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}震えたのはなんだった?　なんだろうね?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.66,0:22:54.05,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}確かめにいこう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.05,0:22:56.16,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}Slowly step, glory days
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:22:59.15,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}So I'm fine today and tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.48,0:23:02.14,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}Let's go out for the weekend
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.14,0:23:04.51,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}Eeny meeny miny moe
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.80,0:21:55.58,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}就算多么精心填好的日程表
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.13,0:22:02.01,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}都随心情左右被抛向六点钟方向
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.48,0:22:06.39,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}若非什么至关重要的约定
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.82,0:22:12.32,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}偶尔心血来潮 也是我模样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.82,0:22:17.38,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}日子依旧日复一日
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.49,0:22:20.57,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}匆匆忙忙停不下脚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.81,0:22:23.47,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}看看这 瞧瞧那 全都出乎意料
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.47,0:22:27.23,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}多彩的意外 根本不会感到无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.38,0:22:30.96,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}来呀 一二三四
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.14,0:22:34.55,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}今天该选什么好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.81,0:22:38.01,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}任性的指尖打着旋儿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.16,0:22:41.55,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}走呀 迷路彼方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.80,0:22:46.98,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}索性踏上崭新的大道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.15,0:22:52.66,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}悸动的是心跳?还是预兆?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.66,0:22:54.05,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}去亲眼确认就好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.05,0:22:56.16,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}慢步走 美好时光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:22:59.15,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}今明往后 我亦无忧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.48,0:23:02.14,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur8}去漫游 就在周末
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.14,0:23:04.51,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{=5}{\fad(200,200)\blur8}点指兵兵 人皆欢心

